# Cyprus: άρθρο 8 of Ν.156(Ι)/2004 (additions to data/extracted/cy/).

lg:CY-156-I-2004
    eli:title "E-Commerce Law 156(I)/2004"@en ;
    lgo:shortName "156(I)/2004" ;
    eli:transposes lg:EU-2000-31 ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <http://www.cylaw.org/nomoi/enop/non-ind/2004_1_156/full.html> ;
    rdfs:comment "Cyprus adds telephone and telefax numbers to the Directive's contact item (γ). The source is the consolidated text on cylaw.org, the Cyprus Bar Association's legislation service."@en .

lg:CY-CAP113
    eli:title "Companies Law, Cap. 113"@en ;
    lgo:shortName "Cap. 113" ;
    eli:transposes lg:EU-2017-1132 ;
    eli:id_local "Cap. 113" ;
    rdfs:comment "Άρθρο 103(1Α) extends the (γ) document items (name, registration number, private/public status, registered office, paid-up capital if stated, liquidation status) verbatim to a company's website; (5) makes a website without them an offence."@en .

lg:CY-NOMOS-85-2017
    eli:transposes lg:EU-2013-11 ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.cylaw.org/nomoi/enop/ind/2017_1_85/full.html> ;
    rdfs:comment "Άρθρο 14 is the trader ADR information duty transposing Directive 2013/11 Art. 13 in full, including the (3) after-complaint duty on paper or another durable medium."@en .
